The mock data includes:
- Basic organization info (id, slug, name)
- Branding details (logo, colors, theme)
- Loading state
- Error handling

This should provide all the necessary context that the `useOrgBranding` hook expects. The error boundary will also help catch and handle any potential issues that might occur during rendering.

